      "openalex_id": "W3204436012",
      "doi": "10.46827/ejsss.v7i1.1154",
      "title": "THE ANGEL OF HISTORY AND THE RUINS OF PARIS: WALTER BENJAMIN IN FRANCE OR THE PROGRESS AS CATASTROPHE",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Emma Barrett Fiedler",
          "openalex_id": "A5011807478"
